    <!-- Mirror of Strings.zh-Hant.xaml in Simplified Chinese. Same keys, same {0} placeholders in
         the same meaning — StringsParityTests fails the build if the dictionaries drift apart.

         Not a script conversion of the Traditional file. The two write software differently —
         设置 / 設定, 鼠标 / 滑鼠, 默认 / 預設, 文件 / 檔案, 界面 / 介面 — and a reader notices the
         wrong side's vocabulary well before they notice the characters. -->

